WEBVTT

00:15.974 --> 00:17.976
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:46.671 --> 00:48.673
[dramatic music playing]

01:11.529 --> 01:12.906
If anything happened to Yul,

01:14.532 --> 01:15.784
Uk will lose control.

01:15.867 --> 01:18.536
This whole time, Uk has
barely contained his anger.

01:19.412 --> 01:20.246
But if…

01:20.872 --> 01:22.707
the Cheonbugwan mages hurt Yul,

01:23.333 --> 01:24.542
Uk may just explode.

01:24.626 --> 01:26.002
I can only pray that nothing--

01:26.086 --> 01:28.088
I know where the gambling den is.
Let me take you there.

01:28.171 --> 01:29.798
We know where the gambling den is located.

01:30.340 --> 01:32.717
But anything could happen,
so please stay here.

01:40.016 --> 01:40.934
[sighs]

01:45.730 --> 01:46.856
[Seo Yul breathes weakly]

01:46.940 --> 01:48.733
[somber music playing]

01:51.820 --> 01:52.654
Yul.

01:54.405 --> 01:55.406
Yul.

01:57.450 --> 01:58.493
Uk.

02:01.496 --> 02:02.497
I'm sorry.

02:11.881 --> 02:14.050
[tense music playing]

02:29.524 --> 02:31.192
Not a single person here…

02:32.527 --> 02:33.945
will leave this place alive.

02:38.825 --> 02:39.868
[mages shout]

02:43.371 --> 02:44.289
[mage grunts]

02:47.000 --> 02:48.793
- [Yeom-su chokes]
- [sword clanks]

02:51.880 --> 02:52.755
What is it?

02:52.839 --> 02:54.132
[chokes]

02:55.174 --> 02:56.384
[in strained voice]
It's an insect

02:57.093 --> 02:59.012
that's placed in one's bloodstream.

02:59.679 --> 03:01.014
So-i was the one.

03:02.098 --> 03:05.602
But I don't know how
it's in Seo Yul's body.

03:05.685 --> 03:07.228
Who put it in So-i's body?

03:09.314 --> 03:11.649
- Jin Mu?
- [breathes roughly]

03:41.804 --> 03:42.764
Yul.

03:44.599 --> 03:45.600
Yul.

03:48.102 --> 03:49.687
[breathes shakily]

03:53.816 --> 03:55.860
Seo Yul was attacked by Cheonbugwan mages?

03:55.944 --> 03:56.861
I don't understand you.

03:56.945 --> 03:59.572
I just received word from Songrim.
Everyone in Daeho is scared.

03:59.656 --> 04:01.032
This must be a mistake.

04:01.115 --> 04:03.493
Why would Cheonbugwan mages
attack Seo Yul?

04:03.576 --> 04:04.619
[mage] My lord!

04:06.412 --> 04:07.413
Something's wrong.

04:07.497 --> 04:10.083
Yeom-su and our mages have been
attacked at the gambling den.

04:10.166 --> 04:11.000
What?

04:11.709 --> 04:13.503
Why would they? By who?

04:13.586 --> 04:16.214
It was Jang Uk.
He single-handedly took them all down.

04:19.300 --> 04:22.303
A dozen or so Cheonbugwan mages
attacked him while he was alone.

04:22.387 --> 04:23.638
If Jang Uk hadn't been there,

04:24.347 --> 04:25.598
Yul would have certainly died.

04:26.933 --> 04:29.143
You said Yul's been taken to Sejukwon.

04:30.770 --> 04:31.980
How is he doing right now?

04:32.063 --> 04:34.732
[Eunuch Oh] They're saying
Seo Yul remains in critical condition.

04:35.483 --> 04:37.694
If Seo Yul really dies because of this,

04:38.486 --> 04:41.197
Songrim and Cheonbugwan will
breakout into a clash.

04:46.452 --> 04:50.581
It's entered into Yul's core of energy.

04:51.082 --> 04:52.875
Then you have to get it out of him.

04:52.959 --> 04:57.380
No one can remove it
when it's in a mage's core of energy.

04:57.463 --> 05:00.508
It will not come out until he is dead.

05:00.591 --> 05:02.010
If his energy surged,

05:02.552 --> 05:04.554
the blood parasites would have, too.

05:05.054 --> 05:07.015
It would have caused him terrible pain.

05:07.098 --> 05:08.558
To fight in this state,

05:08.641 --> 05:11.644
one can only imagine
the pain he felt at the end.

05:13.271 --> 05:14.731
What do you mean the end?

05:16.482 --> 05:17.984
You're telling me Yul's going to die?

05:18.609 --> 05:19.569
[Heo Yeom] Yul.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.779
Please find some way to save him.

05:21.863 --> 05:22.739
[breathes shakily]

05:22.822 --> 05:24.991
There's no way that
we can let him die like this.

05:25.491 --> 05:28.036
What pain my Yul must have suffered!

05:28.619 --> 05:30.288
[tense music playing]

05:30.371 --> 05:31.414
[sobs]

05:32.040 --> 05:32.874
Yul.

05:38.963 --> 05:40.882
[tense music intensifies]

05:43.801 --> 05:44.677
[sighs]

05:44.761 --> 05:47.722
In Seoho Fortress sits
Yul's Lantern of Life.

05:47.805 --> 05:49.098
SEO YUL

05:49.182 --> 05:52.852
[Heo Yeom] If Yul were to die,
his Lantern of Life will go out.

05:53.436 --> 05:56.856
Then his father, General Seo,
would come to the capital

05:56.939 --> 05:59.192
to uncover what was the true cause

05:59.776 --> 06:02.528
of his son's unforeseen demise.

06:04.280 --> 06:06.616
The Seo family retreated
because of Master Seo Gyeong.

06:06.699 --> 06:08.242
They've been protecting
the Seoho Fortress.

06:08.326 --> 06:11.454
If they were to come here and clash
with the Cheonbugwan of the royal family,

06:12.497 --> 06:13.998
it could very well turn into war.

06:14.082 --> 06:15.124
Seo Il…

06:16.125 --> 06:17.627
is your older brother, isn't he?

06:17.710 --> 06:20.004
Reach out to him first, reason with him.

06:21.089 --> 06:24.342
Even if I'm his sister, he won't listen
to someone who switched her body with…

06:25.176 --> 06:26.469
a Choi family shaman.

06:28.221 --> 06:29.138
What you need

06:29.972 --> 06:32.058
is to worry
how Songrim will react to this.

06:33.559 --> 06:34.977
[sighs]

06:38.523 --> 06:39.440
[sighs]

06:40.316 --> 06:42.068
It's been a while since I've seen Uk.

06:42.568 --> 06:43.402
I believe…

06:44.195 --> 06:45.530
that he's gone to Cheonbugwan.

06:45.613 --> 06:49.283
I have no intentions
of trying to stop him from going.

06:49.367 --> 06:52.245
The Seo's heir is near death
because of their actions.

06:52.328 --> 06:55.123
Cheonbugwan has to pay
for what they've done.

06:55.957 --> 06:59.335
I will… go support Jang Uk.

06:59.418 --> 07:00.837
What will Songrim do?

07:02.630 --> 07:05.633
Uncle, I'm yet to have
the confidence to represent Songrim.

07:05.716 --> 07:07.552
But given what's happened to my friend,

07:08.427 --> 07:09.595
I'll go support him as well.

07:11.139 --> 07:13.683
Park Dang-gu. You must protect Songrim.

07:16.394 --> 07:18.855
And Master Heo, you must take care of Yul.

07:21.023 --> 07:22.233
So gather the mages.

07:22.984 --> 07:24.235
As for Cheonbugwan…

07:25.194 --> 07:26.737
I'll go there.

07:30.283 --> 07:33.077
Seo Yul's death should be my no means
connected to Cheonbugwan.

07:33.161 --> 07:35.872
We must summon the Unanimous Assembly
and plead our innocence.

07:35.955 --> 07:37.290
- Yes.
- My lord.

07:37.373 --> 07:39.208
- He's heading here now.
- Who is?

07:39.292 --> 07:41.711
Jang Uk. He's approaching
Cheonbugwan as we speak.

07:45.339 --> 07:47.884
[tense music playing]

07:51.679 --> 07:52.722
[mages scream]

08:04.525 --> 08:05.568
Jang Uk then…

08:06.611 --> 08:08.237
is coming here for me.

08:10.114 --> 08:11.782
Gather all the mages we have right now.

08:11.866 --> 08:14.327
Jang Uk is not to enter Cheonbugwan!
You hear me?

08:14.410 --> 08:15.328
Yes.

08:23.127 --> 08:25.254
They're saying
Jang Uk is headed for Cheonbugwan.

08:25.338 --> 08:27.465
Songrim is preparing
to take action as well.

08:27.548 --> 08:29.967
Sire, whatever shall we do?

08:45.483 --> 08:47.527
[dramatic music playing]

08:57.203 --> 08:58.037
[mage] Fire!

09:19.350 --> 09:22.019
Hold your fire!
Stand for the Crown Prince!

09:22.770 --> 09:25.398
[dramatic music continues playing]

09:35.074 --> 09:36.576
Stop this here, Jang Uk.

09:36.659 --> 09:37.827
Please step aside.

09:37.910 --> 09:39.704
If I do, will you keep
pushing to fight them all?

09:39.787 --> 09:41.289
None of that matters.

09:41.372 --> 09:42.248
I…

09:43.374 --> 09:45.001
will go in there and kill Jin Mu.

09:45.084 --> 09:46.168
[Go Won] To do that,

09:46.836 --> 09:49.338
you'll first have to cut down
every mage in Cheonbugwan.

09:49.422 --> 09:50.256
And then,

09:51.173 --> 09:53.301
you'll have to face
every soldier of the royal palace.

09:53.968 --> 09:55.970
If anyone gets in my way
in order to protect him…

09:57.555 --> 09:58.848
then I have no choice.

10:01.809 --> 10:03.936
That includes you as well, Sire.
So please…

10:05.354 --> 10:07.523
go on and keep hiding
behind him as you always do.

10:09.692 --> 10:12.987
I'm not standing here trying to stop you
because I am protecting Jin Mu!

10:17.825 --> 10:21.078
I'm standing here because I don't want
to see all your hard work be wasted.

10:22.330 --> 10:23.956
I'm aware the sword in your hand…

10:24.832 --> 10:27.168
carries all of the sorrow,
hatred, and rage you feel.

10:35.176 --> 10:36.135
Then you know…

10:37.803 --> 10:39.930
exactly who this is all directed towards.

10:42.683 --> 10:44.352
And I know I'm the reason behind that.

10:46.479 --> 10:48.564
This is why I've been struggling
to face you all this time.

10:51.108 --> 10:53.527
This entire time,
haven't you buried all of your pain

10:53.611 --> 10:57.031
so you could prevent yourself from using
your sword to take revenge on the world?

11:01.327 --> 11:03.412
I stand before you now, knowing full well…

11:11.045 --> 11:12.797
that I may die by that sword…

11:14.298 --> 11:16.676
so that all of your efforts
will not have been for nothing.

11:19.011 --> 11:22.014
[mage] He's readying to attack
His Highness! Weapons ready!

11:23.099 --> 11:23.933
Hold your fire!

11:28.187 --> 11:30.189
[tense music playing]

11:35.778 --> 11:38.447
From this moment forward,
Jang Uk will have

11:39.198 --> 11:40.825
the full support of Songrim

11:41.575 --> 11:42.868
fighting along with him.

11:43.744 --> 11:44.912
So please, Jang Uk,

11:45.496 --> 11:46.705
make sure that you…

11:48.916 --> 11:51.043
move with much thought.

12:09.979 --> 12:11.272
If you point your sword…

12:12.815 --> 12:14.733
and brandish it anywhere in my direction,

12:17.111 --> 12:18.904
then I suppose
I'll have to fight Songrim too.

12:19.864 --> 12:22.408
I'm well aware
you neither like me nor trust me.

12:22.491 --> 12:23.534
But at least…

12:25.244 --> 12:27.746
please do not fall short
of who I expect you to be.

12:27.830 --> 12:29.748
Then I will stay here
and wait for a moment.

12:32.501 --> 12:33.961
So bring Jin Mu right to me.

12:36.130 --> 12:38.132
[tense music playing]

12:45.514 --> 12:47.975
Cheongbugwan mages may
have harmed Seo Yul, but Jang Uk

12:48.058 --> 12:50.102
also murdered all of them.

12:50.686 --> 12:54.356
If we abide by our laws, we could end this
without holding anyone accountable.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.566
So then why…

12:56.525 --> 12:58.569
must I be the one
to answer for Seo Yul's life?

12:58.652 --> 13:00.696
But you are responsible
for the blood parasite.

13:03.449 --> 13:04.867
The blood parasite?

13:04.950 --> 13:06.744
Seo Yul's dying because of that creature…

13:07.620 --> 13:09.371
now eating away at his core of energy.

13:10.581 --> 13:14.251
Before he died, Yeom-su confessed that
you were the one who gave it to him.

13:14.835 --> 13:15.669
[inhales deeply]

13:17.004 --> 13:19.423
The only reason I put
that blood parasite in someone's body

13:19.924 --> 13:21.592
is to keep them under my control.

13:22.218 --> 13:24.220
I have no idea how it came to be in…

13:25.429 --> 13:26.430
in body of Seo Yul.

13:26.514 --> 13:27.431
[Go Won] That doesn't matter.

13:27.515 --> 13:30.726
If your men tried to kill Seo Yul
in order to keep Cheonbugwan's secret,

13:32.061 --> 13:33.729
then the Gwanju should
take responsibility.

13:37.149 --> 13:38.817
But how did it get in?

13:40.152 --> 13:41.654
Thankfully, Seo Yul is alive.

13:42.488 --> 13:44.031
If you tell them how to save him,

13:45.324 --> 13:47.368
then they will not ask
for your life in return.

13:47.451 --> 13:48.536
I don't know how.

13:48.619 --> 13:51.455
Jin U-tak was the one
who retrieved it from Jinyowon.

13:52.665 --> 13:54.375
I don't even know how to control it,

13:54.458 --> 13:57.127
let alone remove it
from the core of his energy.

13:57.211 --> 13:59.004
You must find a way to save him.

14:00.297 --> 14:01.173
And if you don't…

14:03.133 --> 14:05.010
Jang Uk will never back down from this.

14:05.094 --> 14:06.178
[exhales deeply]

14:24.738 --> 14:27.116
Will you stay here waiting
until Jin Mu comes out?

14:27.199 --> 14:29.410
I'm waiting to give it
much thought before I act.

14:30.452 --> 14:33.539
And then… what I'm truly aiming for
will stand before me.

14:33.622 --> 14:37.167
Then are you not aiming
for… Jin Mu's life then?

14:40.671 --> 14:42.047
Please go and stay at Yul's side.

14:42.965 --> 14:46.635
I will find a way to save his life,
no matter what it may be.

14:56.103 --> 14:57.146
[sighs]

14:57.229 --> 15:00.065
[Monk Ho-yeon] Putting the heir
of the Seo family in danger?

15:00.149 --> 15:04.153
You must take full responsibility
for this, Gwanju Jin Mu.

15:04.236 --> 15:08.616
If Seoho Fortress were to mobilize,
Daeho Fortress could find itself at war.

15:08.699 --> 15:09.742
What are you going to do?

15:09.825 --> 15:11.535
Look at this mess that you have made!

15:14.955 --> 15:17.249
That's why I asked you all
here today, mages…

15:18.584 --> 15:21.128
so we could try to prevent
a war from breaking out.

15:21.211 --> 15:23.213
How would we know
how to remove a blood parasite?

15:23.714 --> 15:25.299
Who here has even seen one before?

15:25.382 --> 15:29.428
If Seo Yul dies,
Jang Uk will, for sure, kill you.

15:29.929 --> 15:33.307
Go to him and beg for his forgiveness,
offer your own life.

15:33.390 --> 15:35.643
Then at least we can prevent
a war from breaking out.

15:35.726 --> 15:38.062
[mage 1] He's right! Go beg!
We cannot have a war here!

15:38.145 --> 15:40.105
- [mage 2] Take responsibility!
- Please, everyone, calm down.

15:41.190 --> 15:42.316
I must ask…

15:43.567 --> 15:44.652
that you help me.

15:46.695 --> 15:47.655
[Monk Ho-yeon sighs]

15:49.990 --> 15:51.951
If it is from Jinyowon,

15:52.451 --> 15:54.870
that means Lady Jin may know how.

15:54.954 --> 15:57.998
[mage 3] But last I heard she carries
a deep grudge against Gwanju Jin Mu.

15:58.082 --> 15:59.208
I doubt she'll help him.

15:59.291 --> 16:00.501
Then he'll have to beg.

16:00.584 --> 16:02.670
Jinyowon is our only hope to stop this.

16:03.963 --> 16:05.214
[exhales sharply]

16:10.094 --> 16:10.928
[Jin Mu] Ho-gyeong.

16:11.512 --> 16:13.555
Please, I beg you
to help save your brother.

16:13.639 --> 16:17.017
I have come to you on my knees
asking for your mercy once again.

16:17.101 --> 16:19.979
The Gwanju of Cheonbugwan begging
is quite the sight.

16:20.854 --> 16:23.607
It seems that
you really fear Jang Uk after all.

16:26.485 --> 16:28.779
[Jin Mu] The blood parasite came
from Jinyowon.

16:28.862 --> 16:30.572
So Jinyowon also bears the responsibility.

16:30.656 --> 16:33.617
You and U-tak are responsible.
This has nothing to do with me.

16:34.451 --> 16:35.577
[Monk Ho-yeon] Lady Jin.

16:36.537 --> 16:38.205
If Seo Yul dies like this,

16:38.288 --> 16:40.958
you'll have to bear the wrath as well.

16:41.041 --> 16:42.084
I'm not afraid of that.

16:45.170 --> 16:47.381
If Seo Yul dies and I die with him,

16:48.507 --> 16:49.967
do you really think
that it would end there?

16:50.801 --> 16:53.053
You and I both belong to the Jin family.

16:53.137 --> 16:54.096
We're both guilty.

16:55.222 --> 16:57.349
So Jinyowon will die with me.

16:57.433 --> 16:59.435
[tense music playing]

17:01.937 --> 17:04.606
[Sun] Lady Jin, I command you
to find a way to save Seo Yul

17:04.690 --> 17:06.358
and make Jang Uk leave.

17:07.443 --> 17:09.778
It's maddening knowing that he's there.

17:09.862 --> 17:10.696
[coughs]

17:11.196 --> 17:13.407
I feel like I'm gonna suffocate in here.

17:15.367 --> 17:18.328
Whether it's by sacrificing yourselves
or offering some plan,

17:18.412 --> 17:19.747
find a way to settle.

17:23.375 --> 17:25.419
[tense music playing]

17:32.676 --> 17:33.635
As I promised…

17:35.012 --> 17:36.013
Jin Mu has arrived.

17:37.848 --> 17:39.850
[dramatic music playing]

17:48.317 --> 17:50.527
I believe that there was an error.

17:51.111 --> 17:54.782
Therefore, as the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,
I would like to fully apologize for…

17:55.908 --> 17:58.160
endangering the Seo's heir.

17:59.870 --> 18:01.163
No.

18:01.246 --> 18:03.499
You should apologize to Yul,
and not to me.

18:04.792 --> 18:05.626
After you cure him.

18:08.045 --> 18:09.088
Well, yes, of course.

18:09.171 --> 18:12.549
That is exactly the reason
why I found a way to save him.

18:12.633 --> 18:14.468
[chuckles softly]
Ho-gyeong.

18:24.978 --> 18:27.606
I persuaded Lady Jin,
and together, we found a way.

18:34.988 --> 18:35.823
So then…

18:37.366 --> 18:38.492
we're here once again.

18:39.076 --> 18:40.702
So you managed to drag me here

18:41.620 --> 18:43.080
by causing such a scene.

18:44.623 --> 18:45.541
[Jang Uk] This is why…

18:47.084 --> 18:50.087
you should have told me before
while I was still asking you politely.

18:54.174 --> 18:55.843
So-i wasn't captured and brought here.

18:56.802 --> 18:58.887
She came here with the intention
of saving Yul, didn't she?

19:00.389 --> 19:04.351
So the one she risked
her own life to save was Seo Yul.

19:04.434 --> 19:05.727
But I'm sure you know a way.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.397
You know how to remove
the parasite in his body.

19:09.606 --> 19:10.941
Yul is dying as we speak.

19:13.193 --> 19:15.571
Please help him. I beg of you, Lady Jin.

19:18.073 --> 19:21.577
I'm not interested
in whether Seo Yul lives or dies.

19:22.578 --> 19:24.580
[tense music playing]

19:27.416 --> 19:28.250
I am sorry.

19:40.012 --> 19:41.763
You said that you weren't interested,

19:42.347 --> 19:44.099
so I thought I would grab your attention.

19:44.683 --> 19:45.517
It seems…

19:46.101 --> 19:47.436
you came to me in the end.

19:48.353 --> 19:50.147
I didn't even have to take a step.

19:55.861 --> 19:57.821
So you didn't come here
with the intent to slay me.

19:57.905 --> 20:01.533
You were only using me so that
you can force Lady Jin's hand.

20:01.617 --> 20:04.786
With Yul's life at stake, the only thing
I'm focused on is saving him.

20:05.454 --> 20:07.706
I couldn't care less
about ending your worthless life.

20:09.208 --> 20:10.042
Worthless?

20:16.548 --> 20:19.718
If you knew this beforehand,
you should have told me sooner.

20:20.552 --> 20:25.307
Then I wouldn't have had to humiliate
myself by offering an apology to him.

20:26.016 --> 20:30.812
Why should I be the only one to get
humiliated being forced to come here?

20:32.940 --> 20:34.066
So you can leave now.

20:34.149 --> 20:37.694
Come to Jinyowon,
and I'll tell you how to save him.

20:39.613 --> 20:41.907
[tense music continues]

20:53.627 --> 20:56.338
For three years, you've been obedient
and never made a move.

20:56.421 --> 21:00.092
And yet simply by coming here,
you managed to create a state of panic.

21:00.676 --> 21:02.678
Cheonbugwan, Songrim, Jinyowon,

21:02.761 --> 21:06.306
the Unanimous Assembly,
the royal family and even Seoho.

21:07.975 --> 21:09.351
You are incredible.

21:11.937 --> 21:12.771
And yet…

21:15.607 --> 21:17.234
I stopped like you asked me to.

21:23.991 --> 21:25.117
Gwanju Jin Mu.

21:26.576 --> 21:29.204
I hope you go to
the constellation basin in Cheonbugwan

21:29.705 --> 21:31.873
and pray to the stars
that Yul will survive this.

21:33.333 --> 21:35.085
Because if Yul doesn't survive,
then you will…

21:37.087 --> 21:38.255
surely die.

21:38.964 --> 21:41.008
[tense music playing]

22:06.783 --> 22:09.911
I'm sorry. I should have
immediately told the others…

22:11.705 --> 22:12.998
when I saw something in you.

22:17.461 --> 22:19.463
[somber music playing]

22:22.758 --> 22:24.426
All I'm able to do is see.

22:28.764 --> 22:29.973
I can't do anything else.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.687
- You can have three breaths.
- [gasps]

22:35.771 --> 22:38.857
All my memories
of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

22:45.155 --> 22:47.032
[Yun-ok] You can't just
touch him however you please!

22:50.660 --> 22:53.038
Don't you know
just how critical his condition is?

22:57.209 --> 22:58.502
I heard you knew along,

22:59.628 --> 23:00.796
but you kept it to yourself.

23:03.298 --> 23:04.466
[inhales deeply]

23:05.509 --> 23:06.843
You're interfering. Please go.

23:13.850 --> 23:15.227
[Bu-yeon] What was that just then?

23:23.777 --> 23:25.570
[Sun-i pants]

23:27.364 --> 23:28.657
What are these?

23:29.157 --> 23:31.827
I have no clue what medicine
Young Master Seo had been taking.

23:32.452 --> 23:34.704
He had everything packed up,
so I brought them all for you.

23:36.081 --> 23:37.666
Are you looking for his medicine?

23:37.749 --> 23:38.583
Yeah.

23:50.846 --> 23:51.763
[Sun-i] What's that there?

23:53.306 --> 23:55.267
It appears to be
a letter sealed with energy.

23:56.059 --> 23:58.311
I told you not to touch things
however you please!

24:01.690 --> 24:03.942
I only wanted to see
which medicine he's been taking.

24:04.025 --> 24:05.402
I know how to do that myself.

24:06.236 --> 24:07.070
Please go now.

24:08.238 --> 24:09.322
[sighs]

24:15.704 --> 24:17.831
You think Young Master Seo
sealed it himself?

24:18.915 --> 24:20.041
I think he did.

24:24.004 --> 24:27.007
I asked him to go with me to Danhyanggok
while he was in such pain.

24:28.008 --> 24:28.884
[sighs]

24:30.635 --> 24:33.388
[Bu-yeon] But wait, was that
really a memory just then?

24:34.097 --> 24:36.683
It's not possible that
we've gone to Danhyanggok together.

24:37.309 --> 24:39.394
[Dang-gu] Young Lady Jin.
[pants]

24:39.477 --> 24:41.813
They say they found a way.
Yul can still be saved!

24:41.897 --> 24:42.731
Is that really true?

24:42.814 --> 24:45.650
Lady Jin says there's a way to remove
the blood parasite from his body.

24:46.443 --> 24:49.029
My uncle and Uk have gone over
to Jinyowon to find out.

24:50.447 --> 24:53.700
My mother agreed to tell Uk
how to remove the blood parasite?

24:53.783 --> 24:57.370
Yeah, if Lady Jin offers her help,
I know Yul will make it.

24:57.454 --> 24:59.372
Uk will do anything for him.

24:59.456 --> 25:01.499
I know he'll save Yul, whatever the cost.

25:03.043 --> 25:03.877
I know he will.

25:07.547 --> 25:08.590
Whatever it takes…

25:09.758 --> 25:10.592
he'll do it.

25:11.843 --> 25:13.511
[Ho-gyeong]
The blood parasite is an insect.

25:14.054 --> 25:17.098
And birds are the perfect creature
to get rid of them.

25:17.182 --> 25:20.352
Jinyowon is home
to the most formidable bird.

25:22.145 --> 25:22.979
The fire bird.

25:26.066 --> 25:27.734
How can the fire bird be the answer?

25:28.985 --> 25:30.070
It's way too dangerous.

25:30.153 --> 25:33.114
It is dangerous,
but it's not impossible to use it.

25:35.367 --> 25:36.701
We have Jang Uk, right?

25:39.955 --> 25:42.999
I'll do whatever it takes,
just tell me how to save Yul.

25:43.083 --> 25:44.709
If that's the case, let me ask you.

25:45.252 --> 25:47.963
We both know
you require my help to do this.

25:48.046 --> 25:51.258
If I agree to help,
will you do anything I ask of you?

25:53.969 --> 25:55.887
Send my daughter Bu-yeon back to me.

25:56.471 --> 25:58.306
Then I promise I will help you.

25:59.683 --> 26:00.850
But refuse me…

26:01.893 --> 26:05.188
I won't do a single thing to help you.

26:05.272 --> 26:08.858
Even if you found out how,
you wouldn't be able to…

26:10.402 --> 26:11.528
save your dear friend.

26:12.153 --> 26:12.988
Fine, I agree.

26:14.072 --> 26:15.407
I will do as you like, Lady Jin.

26:16.950 --> 26:17.867
So help us, please!

26:21.204 --> 26:22.122
And Bu-yeon…

26:25.875 --> 26:26.876
I'll send her back to you.

26:27.627 --> 26:28.545
[inhales deeply]

26:29.129 --> 26:30.046
I appreciate it.

26:32.716 --> 26:35.802
Since you're here to witness this,
Jang Uk will keep his word.

26:35.885 --> 26:39.931
You can trust that
Jinyowon will help save Seo Yul.

26:42.058 --> 26:44.394
Thank you for… helping us.

26:51.109 --> 26:51.943
[Heo Yeom] The fire bird?

26:52.485 --> 26:55.405
It will be very dangerous,
but we should try.

26:55.488 --> 26:58.325
Dang-gu, go bring Jin Cho-yeon here.

26:58.950 --> 27:00.702
We will need blood from the Jin family.

27:00.785 --> 27:03.204
- Yes, of course, I'll get her right away.
- [Heo Yeom] Uh.

27:03.830 --> 27:05.790
And you should go over to Seoho Fortress.

27:05.874 --> 27:08.668
If Yul's father hears any strange rumors,

27:08.752 --> 27:10.170
we may expect trouble.

27:10.253 --> 27:13.298
You can explain it all.
Tell him it will be fine.

27:13.381 --> 27:15.425
I'll tell him
that we'll do everything we can.

27:16.051 --> 27:17.260
So please save Yul.

27:18.678 --> 27:20.722
Uk, your role is the most important.

27:20.805 --> 27:22.265
You must enter Jinyowon.

27:22.766 --> 27:26.311
You won't go alone.
Someone that will help is waiting for you.

27:26.811 --> 27:28.855
- Don't pick a fight with him.
- Him? Who?

27:30.106 --> 27:31.149
Who is there?

27:33.735 --> 27:34.819
[Go Won sighs]

27:37.197 --> 27:40.700
I will be the one who enters
Jinyowon alongside Jang Uk.

27:40.784 --> 27:43.953
If you two start bickering in there
and wake the fire bird,

27:45.538 --> 27:47.832
the world will go up in flames.

27:49.042 --> 27:49.876
[sighs]

27:50.377 --> 27:53.046
This will be dangerous.
This is why you should make sure

27:53.129 --> 27:57.050
Jang Uk knows he'll have no choice
but to do what I tell him, Lady Jin.

27:58.176 --> 28:00.512
[Jang Uk] Be serious! Do you really think
the prince will listen to me?

28:00.595 --> 28:02.305
He'll just do what he pleases, saying that

28:02.389 --> 28:04.224
"But I'm the prince."
It'd be better if he wasn't there.

28:04.307 --> 28:06.643
Apparently, the Crown Prince went to
Master Heo himself

28:06.726 --> 28:08.686
and offered his services to help save Yul.

28:09.312 --> 28:11.147
[sighs]
All cause of that turtle?

28:12.690 --> 28:13.608
What do you mean?

28:13.691 --> 28:16.986
Right now, I feel as though
the Crown Prince is slowly crawling

28:17.070 --> 28:18.863
closer towards me as if
he was some kind of turtle.

28:18.947 --> 28:22.242
Or maybe, what's really happening
is that you are slowly letting him in.

28:23.034 --> 28:24.035
[sighs]

28:24.119 --> 28:25.245
But wait, Uk…

28:27.288 --> 28:29.541
are you really going to be all right
without her at your side?

28:34.629 --> 28:36.423
[Jang Uk] I wasn't expecting Lady Jin…

28:37.424 --> 28:39.926
to ask us for something like that
in return for her help.

28:40.635 --> 28:41.761
But if you send her back,

28:42.387 --> 28:46.057
you won't be able to kill yourself
by removing the stone.

28:46.141 --> 28:48.518
Just like the time when
you cooked those awful noodles for me,

28:49.144 --> 28:50.812
someone else came and comforted me too.

28:51.771 --> 28:53.064
They reminded me that

28:53.148 --> 28:55.859
"If you're not going to do anything,
you may as well just die."

28:56.526 --> 28:57.402
It was just…

28:57.944 --> 29:00.655
her way of encouraging me
to do everything while I'm still alive.

29:03.366 --> 29:06.327
Uk, who would you save first
if we were drowning?

29:06.411 --> 29:07.412
Maidservant Kim or me?

29:07.495 --> 29:08.413
Maidservant Kim.

29:08.496 --> 29:10.081
You should save both of us.

29:10.165 --> 29:14.627
Yul and Bu-yeon are both
drowning right now, you fool.

29:14.711 --> 29:15.962
And now you're thinking

29:16.045 --> 29:18.214
Yul is in grave danger
so you'll just give up on her?

29:18.757 --> 29:20.300
But since he is in danger,

29:20.800 --> 29:23.178
I don't have the luxury of deciding
who I have to give up on.

29:25.180 --> 29:26.222
That's not how to do it.

29:29.184 --> 29:30.935
If someone is so dear to you,

29:32.020 --> 29:35.523
don't ever think of
letting them go and abandoning them.

29:43.698 --> 29:46.075
I've been feeling so guilty
for keeping her by my side.

29:48.495 --> 29:49.329
But I know…

29:51.790 --> 29:52.916
this will be for the better.

29:54.626 --> 29:56.628
[pensive music playing]

30:07.847 --> 30:08.932
[Jang Uk exhales]

30:11.684 --> 30:14.229
- I heard that you went to Jinyowon.
- Yeah.

30:14.312 --> 30:17.273
Did my mother tell you
how you should save Yul then?

30:19.359 --> 30:20.193
Mm-hmm.

30:20.276 --> 30:21.444
That's a relief.

30:23.905 --> 30:24.989
I'm happy to help too.

30:25.657 --> 30:27.116
You never know if I'll be of use to you.

30:27.700 --> 30:30.954
You have done everything
that you can to help us already.

30:33.873 --> 30:34.707
But still…

30:36.835 --> 30:39.921
it's better off that
I'm helpful until the end, right?

30:47.554 --> 30:48.888
Don't worry about that.

30:51.057 --> 30:51.891
Stay here.

30:52.725 --> 30:53.935
I'll explain everything…

30:55.019 --> 30:55.979
once it's all over.

31:04.654 --> 31:06.072
I'm not offering to help you out.

31:06.865 --> 31:08.283
Yul is my friend too.

31:08.867 --> 31:10.076
And I'm in his debt.

31:12.245 --> 31:13.079
I want to help.

31:19.752 --> 31:20.587
Fine.

31:21.796 --> 31:22.630
Go ahead.

31:24.257 --> 31:25.091
Let's go.

31:36.352 --> 31:38.855
[Bu-yeon] So then,
he's chosen to let me go.

31:43.484 --> 31:45.361
[suspenseful music playing]

31:45.445 --> 31:50.033
I'll begin with a brief explanation of
this complex parasite removal operation

31:50.116 --> 31:51.618
that Master Heo's prepared for Yul.

31:53.286 --> 31:55.413
Right now, at the core of his energy,

31:55.496 --> 31:58.041
there is a blood parasite
that's straining his life force.

31:58.625 --> 32:00.919
[Dang-gu] The only way he can live is
if his energy remains

32:01.002 --> 32:01.961
when the parasite's removed.

32:02.545 --> 32:05.965
And the only thing
capable of doing so is the fire bird.

32:06.049 --> 32:08.760
What we must do is chase out

32:08.843 --> 32:12.680
the blood parasite
with the fire bird that's inside Jinyowon

32:12.764 --> 32:15.558
and make it expel
the energy it's consumed.

32:15.642 --> 32:19.020
However, there are two complications. Hmm!

32:20.605 --> 32:23.524
The first problem we have is that
we can't transport him to Jinyowon

32:23.608 --> 32:25.360
in the state that he's currently in.

32:25.944 --> 32:28.529
[Dang-gu] And also, the fire bird can't
be removed either.

32:29.656 --> 32:33.076
Our second problem is breaking
the fire bird's barrier is too dangerous.

32:33.159 --> 32:35.870
So we must use its energy
without breaking its barrier.

32:35.954 --> 32:38.539
The first problem is not possible.

32:38.623 --> 32:41.501
[Cho-yeon]
We can't move Yul or the fire bird.

32:41.584 --> 32:43.878
So how can we use
the fire bird to do that?

32:43.962 --> 32:46.798
That's why we called you here, Cho-yeon.

32:46.881 --> 32:51.386
You must open the gate
and enter Jinyowon in place of Yul's body.

32:52.303 --> 32:53.304
What? Me?

32:54.430 --> 32:59.644
This is the water wick
used in Seo family's Lanterns of Life.

33:00.228 --> 33:04.941
[Heo Yeom] Members of the Seo family
always fill these wicks with their energy

33:05.024 --> 33:07.694
in order to connect
to their Lanterns of Life. 

33:07.777 --> 33:10.071
This has been
their practice for centuries.

33:10.154 --> 33:10.989
SEO YUL

33:11.072 --> 33:15.076
I will fill this
with what still remains within Yul.

33:15.159 --> 33:17.662
Then the blood parasite will think

33:17.745 --> 33:21.082
this is really his core of energy
and enter this instead.

33:22.000 --> 33:24.293
Then we can just remove
the parasite with this!

33:24.377 --> 33:27.797
Did you hear me when I say that it has to
expel everything it has consumed?

33:27.880 --> 33:28.881
But why…

33:29.549 --> 33:32.010
must I be the one
who takes it to Jinyowon?

33:32.093 --> 33:34.971
That's because the blood parasite was made

33:35.054 --> 33:36.931
with some of your family's own blood.

33:38.141 --> 33:38.975
What?

33:39.058 --> 33:40.977
Why do you think
that Jin Mu put it in So-i?

33:41.728 --> 33:44.272
He put your family's energy
in that parasite

33:44.355 --> 33:46.983
and put it in her
so she could open Jinyowon.

33:47.525 --> 33:48.401
[yelps]

33:49.152 --> 33:52.572
[Dang-gu] So then the blood parasite was
made with Cho-yeon's blood.

33:52.655 --> 33:57.452
Once that parasite mistakes this
for the real thing and enters into it,

33:57.535 --> 34:01.873
I will put this into Cho-yeon's body
which has the same energy

34:01.956 --> 34:04.333
- as the blood parasite.
- [Dang-gu exclaims]

34:04.959 --> 34:07.045
- Isn't that gonna be dangerous though?
- [Heo Yeom] Ah!

34:07.128 --> 34:09.756
Just place this in your mouth
and do not open it.

34:11.758 --> 34:12.592
Right.

34:13.259 --> 34:14.302
I will carry it then.

34:14.385 --> 34:17.346
[Heo Yeom] Good! Even someone who can't
wield magic can do this.

34:17.889 --> 34:21.392
It will be fine if you don't have
any parasites or are expecting.

34:22.101 --> 34:23.478
What?

34:23.561 --> 34:24.645
Oh! Oh, hold on!

34:26.355 --> 34:27.982
Uh, do you…

34:28.941 --> 34:31.861
Young Lady Jin, remember that one night?

34:33.154 --> 34:36.407
You know, that day when we went to
the house that was supposed to be ours.

34:37.283 --> 34:38.117
Maybe…

34:40.161 --> 34:41.079
[gasps]

34:41.162 --> 34:42.872
[whimsical music playing]

34:42.955 --> 34:45.124
[breathes deeply, moans]

34:45.208 --> 34:47.960
She can't! She, uh…
she's not able to do it.

34:48.044 --> 34:49.587
Not if there's even
the slightest possibility

34:49.670 --> 34:50.713
that she's pregnant.

34:50.797 --> 34:51.756
- You little…
- [Dang-gu groans]

34:55.426 --> 34:57.929
So then, do we need
to ask Lady Jin to do it?

34:58.846 --> 35:01.974
She must stay outside Jinyowon's door
to ensure the other relics

35:02.058 --> 35:03.184
don't end up turning on us.

35:03.267 --> 35:04.102
Then…

35:05.311 --> 35:06.437
I'm willing to do it myself.

35:07.105 --> 35:12.110
But you two are already married.
Are… Are you sure? Will it be all right?

35:12.693 --> 35:13.611
Don't worry about that.

35:14.320 --> 35:16.280
[scoffs]
That's not possible at all.

35:18.116 --> 35:19.242
- Not at all?
- Yeah.

35:19.742 --> 35:21.494
Not even the slightest chance
of that happening.

35:24.038 --> 35:24.914
[inhales deeply]

35:24.997 --> 35:25.873
Yeah, she's right.

35:28.751 --> 35:30.545
- I'm telling you it's true.
- [Heo Yeom] Hmm!

35:31.754 --> 35:36.676
I guess Bu-yeon can be the one
to carry, uh, Yul's energy over there.

35:38.469 --> 35:39.804
[Dang-gu sighs]
So now,

35:39.887 --> 35:41.389
we just have the second problem left.

35:42.140 --> 35:45.184
How can we extract the fire bird's energy
without breaking the barrier?

35:45.268 --> 35:49.355
[Heo Yeom] The barrier of the fire bird
is made of an energy 

35:49.438 --> 35:52.191
that's similar to the volcano
where it was born.

35:52.275 --> 35:56.612
It's made of an energy
from gold that's 30,000 nyang.

35:56.696 --> 36:00.908
We must use gold to recreate it
and expand the barrier,

36:00.992 --> 36:02.493
to go inside it.

36:02.577 --> 36:05.872
Whoa, so we need
the energy of 30,000 nyang in gold?

36:05.955 --> 36:09.083
Where could we possibly get
30,000 nyang of gold at this hour?

36:09.709 --> 36:13.588
Sang-ho is gathering it now.
I know we're in a rush,

36:13.671 --> 36:17.091
but it will take some time
to gather 30,000 nyang in gold.

36:17.175 --> 36:18.593
I have 30,000 nyang.

36:18.676 --> 36:20.428
I mean, I also have that much money.

36:20.511 --> 36:23.055
But the only problem is that
I can't get it in gold right now.

36:23.139 --> 36:24.390
No, I'm saying I have the gold now.

36:27.101 --> 36:28.144
It's at Jeongjingak.

36:28.227 --> 36:29.228
What?

36:30.855 --> 36:31.939
Here?

36:32.023 --> 36:32.857
Yeah.

36:34.066 --> 36:34.901
Hmm.

36:47.622 --> 36:50.666
Every time the Crown Prince rewarded me,
I stashed it in here.

36:51.334 --> 36:52.168
[Dang-gu] Wow!

36:52.251 --> 36:55.087
So you just left all of it here like this?

36:55.171 --> 36:57.798
Well, I have no need for it
and didn't want to drag it home.

36:58.466 --> 37:02.345
I get 1,000 nyang for each soul shifter,
so there should be 30,000 nyang.

37:02.428 --> 37:03.512
Excellent!

37:03.596 --> 37:06.390
Then we are ready to remove that parasite.

37:06.474 --> 37:07.308
Let's start.

37:07.975 --> 37:10.561
Dang-gu and Cho-yeon,
move the gold we need to Jinyowon.

37:11.187 --> 37:14.607
And I'll follow you
once we get Yul's energy into her.

37:17.151 --> 37:17.985
[Dang-gu] Hmm.

37:24.533 --> 37:25.493
[Heo Yeom sighs]

37:39.215 --> 37:43.552
And now, the energy
in him will no longer surge.

37:44.053 --> 37:46.347
And all the energy in his core…

37:47.556 --> 37:50.476
will be sent
to the water wick of his Lantern.

37:51.560 --> 37:52.436
[sighs]

37:58.359 --> 38:01.737
I can see the blood parasite
leaving his core of energy.

38:02.238 --> 38:03.489
[moans softly]

38:03.572 --> 38:04.699
Okay now.

38:05.574 --> 38:06.742
[grunts]

38:07.743 --> 38:10.329
[suspenseful music playing]

38:19.880 --> 38:21.382
Open your mouth.

38:30.975 --> 38:31.809
This here

38:32.601 --> 38:35.396
is the same as what remains of Yul's life.

38:36.439 --> 38:37.398
You must not swallow it,

38:38.357 --> 38:40.693
or even open your mouth before then.

38:46.157 --> 38:49.035
Yul can only hold on for this much time.

38:49.118 --> 38:50.411
[Heo Yeom] You must return

38:50.995 --> 38:53.831
only with his torrent of energy
before time's up.

38:54.707 --> 38:56.959
Uk, I trust you with this.

38:57.043 --> 38:58.336
Yes, I'll make sure…

38:59.462 --> 39:00.671
we're back before time runs out.

39:02.465 --> 39:03.299
Let's go.

39:04.884 --> 39:05.926
[sighs]

39:10.973 --> 39:12.141
[Go Won sighs]

39:12.683 --> 39:16.562
So this pile of gold is from
all those times I rewarded Jang Uk?

39:17.605 --> 39:19.774
He never used a single one,
just piled them here.

39:19.857 --> 39:22.151
He'll live thanks to Jang Uk.

39:23.194 --> 39:26.197
We must protect Jinyowon's door
with my mother.

39:27.573 --> 39:28.991
You can wait here, Your Highness…

39:30.326 --> 39:32.828
since Jang Uk and my sister
will be here soon.

39:34.038 --> 39:35.206
Jin Bu-yeon will be here too?

39:35.915 --> 39:38.334
Yes. Please don't start arguing with Uk.

39:38.417 --> 39:39.251
We won't argue.

39:40.044 --> 39:42.588
Jang Uk and I share a turtle together.

39:45.883 --> 39:47.385
Have you seen how smart that thing is?

39:48.427 --> 39:49.553
[chuckles]

39:53.307 --> 39:54.767
Bu-yeon, why did you come here as well?

39:54.850 --> 39:56.477
How did you get involved in this?

39:57.144 --> 39:58.354
Haven't you told her yet?

40:00.898 --> 40:04.527
Right now, she can't speak
as she has Seo Yul's energy in her mouth.

40:08.364 --> 40:10.991
When you enter into Jinyowon,
the Prince will be waiting for you there.

40:11.075 --> 40:12.201
Go on ahead.

40:22.711 --> 40:24.463
If you don't keep the promise you made me,

40:24.547 --> 40:26.966
then I will refuse to save him.

40:27.049 --> 40:29.927
I promise I'll keep my end of the bargain
and send her home, so you…

40:32.263 --> 40:33.222
can rest assured.

40:33.305 --> 40:35.933
[tense music playing]

40:54.743 --> 40:56.954
Turtle Shaman? What are you doing here?

40:57.580 --> 40:58.956
Are you working at Jinyowon now?

41:01.250 --> 41:03.210
[quirky music playing]

41:04.503 --> 41:05.379
Uh…

41:05.463 --> 41:09.425
Currently, I'm doing my job,
you know, with the Prince.

41:09.508 --> 41:11.218
I, uh, with His Highness.

41:13.512 --> 41:14.805
[Jang Uk]
Thanks for waiting, Your Highness.

41:21.645 --> 41:22.521
Yeah, right.

41:23.105 --> 41:24.815
Yes, that's me.

41:25.399 --> 41:27.693
It's been me, the Prince, all along.

41:32.406 --> 41:33.240
But wait!

41:34.492 --> 41:35.951
Then are you Jin Bu-yeon?

41:37.453 --> 41:39.747
Yeah, this is Jin Bu-yeon, Your Highness.

41:39.830 --> 41:43.459
Hold on! She's not a shaman,
but the Jinyowon priestess, Jin Bu-yeon?

41:43.542 --> 41:45.085
You know who she is?

41:45.794 --> 41:46.795
You know him?

41:47.421 --> 41:48.923
Then your husband is…

41:55.471 --> 41:56.472
What's wrong?

42:03.771 --> 42:06.106
The turtle? Oh, the eunuch.

42:08.901 --> 42:09.944
That was him?

42:10.736 --> 42:11.987
The Crown Prince, I mean,

42:12.655 --> 42:14.323
His Royal Highness was the eunuch?

42:18.452 --> 42:19.286
[sighs]

42:20.746 --> 42:22.039
I get why now…

42:23.332 --> 42:26.669
you'd take care of my turtle
like that, Jang Uk.

42:28.462 --> 42:29.338
Jeez!

42:29.838 --> 42:30.673
[clicks tongue]

42:31.966 --> 42:32.800
[sighs]

42:39.765 --> 42:42.059
[Eunuch Oh] His Royal Highness said
you would be only safe

42:42.142 --> 42:45.479
if Seo Yul survives this ordeal,
and want to help them save him.

42:48.107 --> 42:50.776
Let us hope that
His Royal Highness is not just using this

42:50.859 --> 42:52.570
as an excuse to kill me.

42:54.071 --> 42:56.448
[Jin Mu] Did you say he rescued
this turtle and brought it here?

42:56.532 --> 42:59.076
Yes, His Highness saved
that turtle from getting killed himself.

42:59.159 --> 43:02.580
Why would he bother
raising something so weak and useless?

43:07.376 --> 43:09.044
[Jang Uk] First, I'll summon
the energy of the gold

43:09.128 --> 43:11.714
and use it to expand the barrier
surrounding the fire bird's egg.

43:11.797 --> 43:13.007
Then all you have to do

43:13.090 --> 43:16.093
is capture the parasite
shocked by the fire bird's energy.

43:16.176 --> 43:17.970
And after that,
it will come out of her body?

43:18.554 --> 43:19.388
Understood.

43:19.972 --> 43:21.432
Shaman, come in now.

43:24.977 --> 43:26.770
[whimsical music playing]

43:32.276 --> 43:34.612
So Jang Uk was the one troubling you?

43:34.695 --> 43:37.156
You must have suffered
far greater than I thought.

43:38.198 --> 43:40.284
Ah, did you find your own room?

43:41.410 --> 43:43.537
You should have listened to me
and come to my house.

43:44.330 --> 43:45.247
I live in the palace.

43:45.956 --> 43:48.000
[Go Won] It's not like
I have plenty of rooms, right?

43:48.083 --> 43:48.917
[Bu-yeon chuckles]

43:52.588 --> 43:54.506
What's wrong? Surge the energy.

43:58.927 --> 44:00.638
[dramatic music playing]

44:27.623 --> 44:30.542
The blood parasite's emerged.
It's moving through her bloodstream.

44:30.626 --> 44:33.504
You must wait until it expels
all of Yul's torrent of energy.

44:34.046 --> 44:35.464
Hang in there. You got this, Bu-yeon.

44:41.303 --> 44:42.304
[Go Won breathes heavily]

44:49.895 --> 44:51.563
His torrent of energy has returned.

44:52.147 --> 44:53.857
All that's left is to remove the parasite.

44:53.941 --> 44:54.775
Where did it go?

45:01.698 --> 45:03.534
[dramatic music playing]

45:11.250 --> 45:12.126
[knife clanks]

45:20.634 --> 45:21.510
[Go Won grunts]

45:24.471 --> 45:25.472
Hang in there.

45:31.812 --> 45:32.813
Are you okay?

45:33.939 --> 45:34.898
It must really hurt.

45:40.863 --> 45:41.822
Let's see how he's doing.

45:42.698 --> 45:43.532
Let's go.

45:49.455 --> 45:50.372
[Jang Uk sighs]

45:59.339 --> 46:00.174
Now me.

46:00.257 --> 46:03.594
The gold barrier must not be broken.
So be careful on your way out of there.

46:04.428 --> 46:05.804
[Jang Uk] Let's hurry. Time's almost up.

46:08.849 --> 46:09.808
Me too!

46:18.275 --> 46:19.234
Hey!

46:19.902 --> 46:22.529
[suspenseful music playing]

46:22.613 --> 46:23.489
[sighs]

46:29.203 --> 46:31.747
[yelps]
Time! It's almost up!

46:31.830 --> 46:33.040
Quick! Quick! Get it in his mouth.

46:33.123 --> 46:34.625
Now! Now! Let's go!

46:36.168 --> 46:37.002
Go!

46:39.171 --> 46:41.840
[suspenseful music playing]

46:59.149 --> 47:00.359
[music fades]

47:01.151 --> 47:02.569
- [gasps]
- [Bu-yeon gasps]

47:06.823 --> 47:10.702
Oh! He's safe! He's safe!

47:10.786 --> 47:12.371
[Heo Yeom laughs]

47:13.121 --> 47:14.998
[Heo Yeom] We did it! We really did it!

47:15.749 --> 47:18.293
Seo Yul is alive!
[laughs]

47:18.377 --> 47:21.797
Oh, Yul! I… I can feel his pulse again.

47:21.880 --> 47:22.923
I can't believe it!

47:24.132 --> 47:25.259
We did it!

47:25.342 --> 47:26.677
- [Heo Yeom] My goodness.
- Seo Yul's alive then.

47:26.760 --> 47:27.636
- Yeah.
- [Heo Yeon] Oh, Yul!

47:27.719 --> 47:29.304
- My goodness, we did it! Well done.
- You did good, Jang Uk.

47:31.640 --> 47:32.683
You did too…

47:33.767 --> 47:34.851
Your Royal Highness.

47:36.812 --> 47:37.813
[Go Won sighs]

47:37.896 --> 47:38.772
[Bu-yeon chuckles]

47:41.316 --> 47:42.276
I still…

47:42.901 --> 47:45.153
can't believe you were the husband
that was troubling her.

47:45.862 --> 47:46.697
[scoffs]

47:46.780 --> 47:50.117
I'd like to know why did
Bu-yeon mistake you for a eunuch?

47:52.286 --> 47:53.662
Well, we saved the turtle together.

47:54.746 --> 47:58.875
Next time, I'll invite her
to the palace so she can visit the turtle.

48:02.212 --> 48:03.213
And if you'd like…

48:05.507 --> 48:06.717
you're welcome to join her.

48:12.222 --> 48:13.265
The turtle?

48:13.348 --> 48:14.224
[scoffs]

48:29.948 --> 48:30.866
Job well done.

48:32.993 --> 48:34.036
Thank you.

48:40.834 --> 48:42.878
[Yun-ok] This was among
Young Master Seo's belongings.

48:42.961 --> 48:46.506
I meant to give this before
Lord Park left for Seoho Fortress.

48:46.590 --> 48:48.592
Lord Park's already gone.
He left earlier this morning.

48:48.675 --> 48:49.551
Ah.

48:50.135 --> 48:51.261
I guess I'm too late.

48:51.845 --> 48:53.221
I'll put it back with his things.

48:58.393 --> 49:00.562
The cut the parasite came out of
might fester.

49:01.438 --> 49:04.900
Make sure to apply ointment
and take your medicine on time.

49:05.400 --> 49:06.234
Fine.

49:06.777 --> 49:08.028
I'll be fine staying here too.

49:11.073 --> 49:12.324
I'm not as dense as you think.

49:12.991 --> 49:14.618
I expected my mother to demand that

49:15.243 --> 49:17.204
in return for her helping you save him.

49:19.498 --> 49:20.916
She wants you to go back home.

49:22.459 --> 49:23.418
And I agreed to it.

49:23.502 --> 49:24.836
You think you're sending me back?

49:26.296 --> 49:28.423
I'm leaving you on my own will.

49:28.507 --> 49:30.384
[somber music playing]

49:30.467 --> 49:32.177
My mother gave me her word too.

49:33.095 --> 49:36.181
She promised
it wouldn't be like it was before.

49:37.557 --> 49:39.351
I have nothing to lose even if I go.

49:41.186 --> 49:43.522
- But I feel bad leaving you.
- Meaning?

49:44.606 --> 49:46.441
Because I promised
to help you sleep, you know.

49:47.025 --> 49:48.235
Isn't this why you brought me here?

49:48.318 --> 49:49.945
But I'm leaving
without being able to help.

49:50.529 --> 49:51.655
You're misunderstanding me.

49:53.073 --> 49:54.449
That's not the reason
why I brought you here.

49:55.492 --> 49:56.326
Then…

49:57.744 --> 49:59.329
why did you really bring me here?

50:01.248 --> 50:02.499
It doesn't matter anymore.

50:03.208 --> 50:04.918
And I won't need
your help with that again.

50:05.001 --> 50:06.795
I also don't have anything to lose.

50:07.921 --> 50:09.256
So don't feel sorry because you're going.

50:09.339 --> 50:11.675
Even a brazier in the summer would be
missed if it goes out.

50:12.300 --> 50:14.094
Can't you say you'll miss me
even if it isn't true?

50:15.929 --> 50:17.389
A brazier during the summer is…

50:18.932 --> 50:20.225
pretty useless to begin with.

50:21.601 --> 50:22.436
Who knows?

50:23.228 --> 50:24.187
Maybe someday…

50:26.481 --> 50:27.649
I'll miss you when it gets chilly.

50:28.692 --> 50:29.568
[sighs]

50:31.695 --> 50:32.529
Fine then.

50:33.155 --> 50:36.575
Your useless brazier is leaving as nothing
more than ashes after burning out.

50:37.367 --> 50:39.244
I'll disperse into the wind, and you…

50:43.540 --> 50:45.041
can freeze to death all alone.

50:48.670 --> 50:50.672
[somber music playing]

50:59.389 --> 51:00.390
[sighs]

51:06.855 --> 51:10.609
His energy is surging again
within his core.

51:10.692 --> 51:14.446
The fire bird has driven out
the parasite completely .

51:14.529 --> 51:17.657
Jang Uk and the Crown Prince
saw it with their own eyes then?

51:17.741 --> 51:18.617
Yes.

51:18.700 --> 51:22.662
They, somehow, stopped
their bickering and kept it under control

51:22.746 --> 51:24.372
so they could save Yul here.

51:24.456 --> 51:27.167
It seems sending the Prince
to deliver his rewards

51:27.250 --> 51:28.919
as an excuse to check on Uk…

51:30.045 --> 51:31.713
must have paid off after all.

51:33.131 --> 51:34.132
[scoffs]

51:37.886 --> 51:40.555
You managed to save my life
once again, Your Royal Highness.

51:41.848 --> 51:42.682
I did not.

51:43.266 --> 51:45.268
Last time, I saved you so that
you'd kill Jang Uk.

51:45.352 --> 51:46.186
But this time…

51:47.604 --> 51:50.982
Jang Uk and I joined forces
because I wanted to save Seo Yul.

51:51.066 --> 51:52.859
But just like I did last time…

51:54.194 --> 51:57.697
I'll give you something in return
to show my thanks.

51:58.573 --> 52:01.618
[dramatic music playing]

52:11.294 --> 52:13.797
This is the constellation plate
from the day Jang Uk was born.

52:13.880 --> 52:15.215
Is that the King's Star I see?

52:16.675 --> 52:18.134
[Jin Mu] That is correct.

52:18.218 --> 52:21.012
The late king's son was born
under the King's Star

52:21.096 --> 52:22.681
just as Jang Gang prophesized.

52:26.393 --> 52:27.352
The son of the late king?

52:29.187 --> 52:30.021
Jang Uk…

52:30.689 --> 52:33.441
is the son of the late king
who shifted souls with Jang Gang.

52:34.109 --> 52:36.152
That is why he is under the King's Star.

52:37.070 --> 52:39.739
He also has the Gold Plaque and the letter

52:39.823 --> 52:41.950
that the late king left for his son.

52:42.033 --> 52:46.329
He's a dangerous star
who's ready to take your place anytime.

52:54.379 --> 52:56.840
Is that why you wanted me
to keep my distance from him?

52:59.217 --> 53:02.137
Please, Sire, just consider my plan…

53:03.054 --> 53:05.181
that would send Jang Uk far away.

53:11.938 --> 53:12.981
[sighs]

53:17.986 --> 53:21.740
You must have used
a lot of energy, dear Mother.

53:23.408 --> 53:24.868
Your hair started turning gray

53:25.577 --> 53:27.829
after these past few days, Mother.

53:31.625 --> 53:32.459
Cho-yeon.

53:33.835 --> 53:35.420
Please prepare Bu-yeon's room for her.

53:35.503 --> 53:37.756
Is she then coming back home soon?

53:39.132 --> 53:40.592
Jang Uk gave me his word.

53:41.885 --> 53:43.011
So she'll be here soon.

53:43.094 --> 53:44.804
[breathes deeply]

53:44.888 --> 53:46.014
[exhale deeply]

53:50.018 --> 53:53.563
Young Master, how's Young Master Seo?
Is he doing all right?

53:54.189 --> 53:56.858
Yeah, I wanted to see him when he woke up.

53:56.942 --> 53:59.486
But I was worried my energy
could harm him so I had to leave.

53:59.569 --> 54:01.029
[exhales]
That's a relief.

54:01.738 --> 54:03.740
You did great, Young Master.

54:04.282 --> 54:05.367
You saved your friend.

54:06.785 --> 54:07.661
Have you seen her yet?

54:08.328 --> 54:09.913
- Did she go?
- Young Lady Jin?

54:11.957 --> 54:13.166
She hasn't come home yet.

54:13.792 --> 54:15.543
I thought you were at Songrim together.

54:16.461 --> 54:17.462
She hasn't come home?

54:18.880 --> 54:22.092
What? Did she really leave
without saying goodbye to Maidservant Kim?

54:22.175 --> 54:25.929
What do you mean?
Did she return home to Jinyowon?

54:26.012 --> 54:29.766
Uh-huh. I promised Lady Jin
that I would send her back.

54:29.849 --> 54:31.184
Did you really now?

54:31.977 --> 54:34.938
Oh! My dear, give me your hand.

54:35.438 --> 54:36.564
Your hand!

54:37.273 --> 54:40.485
Foolish boy! What do you mean?
Send her back? She's not an object!

54:40.568 --> 54:43.154
I only said that because she's going back
to where she came from.

54:43.238 --> 54:45.824
But the place that
she's supposed to be is right here.

54:48.493 --> 54:51.413
There was… never a place for her here.

54:57.127 --> 54:58.211
Oh, goodness.

54:58.878 --> 55:01.131
He'll never know
what he's given up until it's gone.

55:02.632 --> 55:04.759
You will keep changing your mind.

55:05.885 --> 55:07.137
This foolish boy!

55:08.388 --> 55:09.806
He has to come to his senses.

55:15.603 --> 55:16.479
So she…

55:18.023 --> 55:19.190
left right away.

55:19.274 --> 55:22.861
Your useless brazier's leaving as nothing
more than ashes after burning out.

55:22.944 --> 55:25.155
I'll disperse into the wind, and you…

55:27.240 --> 55:28.742
can freeze to death all alone.

55:30.744 --> 55:31.578
[sighs]

55:39.377 --> 55:40.336
[yelps in pain]

55:41.087 --> 55:42.005
[groans]

55:44.466 --> 55:45.550
So her mother…

55:46.801 --> 55:48.303
wouldn't do that again, right?

55:51.723 --> 55:53.808
["Blue flower" by LIA playing]

56:06.404 --> 56:07.238
[Bu-yeon] So that…

56:07.989 --> 56:09.365
you don't get confused anymore.

56:10.617 --> 56:13.745
I will make it
a warm, comfortable place for you.

56:18.875 --> 56:19.959
See! It's warm.

56:39.354 --> 56:40.563
[Jang Uk] She left this here.

56:40.647 --> 56:42.524
I was gonna use it as an excuse.

56:46.069 --> 56:47.278
She should be there now, right?

56:48.029 --> 56:50.281
["Blue flower" by LIA continues playing]

56:59.582 --> 57:01.501
[Jang Uk] You can go ahead
and turn off the last lantern.

57:01.584 --> 57:03.795
Since you're
a great priestess of Jinyowon,

57:03.878 --> 57:05.672
use your great divine power
to turn it off.

57:12.720 --> 57:14.973
Look, right there! Look, I did it again!

57:15.557 --> 57:16.850
[both chuckle]

57:17.475 --> 57:18.518
[sighs]

57:29.404 --> 57:32.365
- [ominous music playing]
- [groans softly]

57:35.326 --> 57:36.369
[mages shout]

57:41.791 --> 57:43.084
- Yul.
- [gasps]

57:54.012 --> 57:56.431
Young Master, are you finally awake then?

57:58.975 --> 58:00.059
What happened to me?

58:00.143 --> 58:01.853
You almost died back there.

58:02.437 --> 58:05.106
You've been unconscious
for three whole days now.

58:05.773 --> 58:06.608
[Seo Yul exhales]

58:10.069 --> 58:11.279
So-i, is she okay?

58:12.864 --> 58:15.366
Do you mean that girl you tried to save?

58:15.450 --> 58:16.493
She died.

58:19.287 --> 58:21.789
Lord Dang-gu retrieved her body for you.

58:21.873 --> 58:24.292
Master Heo and your friends managed to

58:24.375 --> 58:26.169
remove the blood parasite from your body.

58:27.629 --> 58:28.713
They were able to remove it?

58:29.589 --> 58:30.423
Yes.

58:35.094 --> 58:36.095
- [exhales deeply]
- [door opens]

58:42.644 --> 58:43.645
You're finally awake now?

58:45.813 --> 58:48.441
[sighs]
We almost didn't make it, Yul.

58:49.234 --> 58:52.487
Young Lady Jin was vital
in clearing the blood parasite.

58:53.821 --> 58:56.241
[Bu-yeon] Had I known
the thing inside you was so dangerous,

58:56.324 --> 58:57.617
I wouldn't have kept it a secret.

58:58.243 --> 58:59.160
I'm sorry for…

58:59.702 --> 59:02.580
asking you to go to
Danhyanggok in that state.

59:06.417 --> 59:08.336
We agreed we would go together, but…

59:12.090 --> 59:13.007
we couldn't.

59:14.759 --> 59:15.635
[door opens]

59:17.512 --> 59:20.431
Master Lee,
Seo Yul's regained consciousness.

59:21.099 --> 59:22.058
[door closes]

59:22.141 --> 59:24.602
- Master Lee?
- [Bu-yeon] This is Master Lee.

59:24.686 --> 59:26.688
He's been the one taking care of you.

59:27.480 --> 59:28.856
Young Master Seo does know him.

59:29.357 --> 59:31.651
After all, he was the master
of Master Heo.

59:31.734 --> 59:34.195
The "frivolous Yeom"
that you always told me stories about

59:34.696 --> 59:36.364
was really Master Heo?

59:36.447 --> 59:38.575
When Yeom was your age,
he was adorable too.

59:39.158 --> 59:40.577
- A little.
- [Bu-yeon chuckles]

59:41.995 --> 59:44.831
He was the physician who took care of me
for three years when I was ill.

59:45.498 --> 59:48.418
[Bu-yeon] He's Daeho's best physician,
so you'll be better soon.

59:48.501 --> 59:50.753
Bu-yeon, go bring Yeom over here.

59:51.337 --> 59:52.880
He'll be thrilled to hear Yul's awake.

59:52.964 --> 59:54.132
Yes, Master.

01:00:01.598 --> 01:00:04.058
You've regained nearly
all of your torrent of energy,

01:00:04.142 --> 01:00:05.310
so you'll recover soon.

01:00:05.893 --> 01:00:06.769
[door closes]

01:00:06.853 --> 01:00:08.354
If you took care of her back then,

01:00:09.480 --> 01:00:11.149
Jin Bu-yeon must be someone you know well.

01:00:12.400 --> 01:00:15.987
You just woke up and you're seriously
asking me about Jin Bu-yeon.

01:00:16.654 --> 01:00:18.656
You're right. I am the one who saved her.

01:00:19.240 --> 01:00:21.868
And I promise I'll take care of you too.

01:00:26.122 --> 01:00:28.958
[Maid Kim] Young Lady Jin
is at Sejukwon in Songrim?

01:00:29.042 --> 01:00:33.129
Yeah. Her mother believes
that she's still at Uk's house,

01:00:33.212 --> 01:00:35.506
while Uk must think she went to Jinyowon.

01:00:36.591 --> 01:00:38.801
Is it really over between them?

01:00:39.844 --> 01:00:43.556
Whenever she would leave our house,
he would go and bring her back every time.

01:00:44.140 --> 01:00:46.392
And she must be choosing
to stay in Songrim

01:00:46.476 --> 01:00:48.728
because she's been waiting
for him to come bring her back.

01:00:49.354 --> 01:00:51.064
- Hmm.
- Let's just let them be.

01:00:54.400 --> 01:00:55.985
Oh, Lord Park's here.
[chuckles]

01:00:56.069 --> 01:00:58.613
You only appreciate someone
once they're gone.

01:00:58.696 --> 01:01:00.490
Lord Park!
[chuckles]

01:01:01.074 --> 01:01:02.575
How did your trip go?

01:01:02.659 --> 01:01:03.910
You must be exhausted.

01:01:04.869 --> 01:01:07.789
I hurried here since I knew
you would be waiting.

01:01:07.872 --> 01:01:10.541
- [chuckles]
- Oh, my! He's watching us.

01:01:10.625 --> 01:01:11.584
[chuckles]

01:01:11.668 --> 01:01:13.086
[Maid Kim chuckles]
Come inside.

01:01:15.755 --> 01:01:17.507
You shouldn't be walking around just yet.

01:01:19.509 --> 01:01:21.052
Had you already known who that girl…

01:01:22.553 --> 01:01:23.388
actually was?

01:01:25.181 --> 01:01:27.892
You must have known then
if you pulled her body out of the lake.

01:01:27.975 --> 01:01:29.644
So you recognized her face then.

01:01:31.062 --> 01:01:34.273
Well, you did say you had met Naksu
when she was living in Danghyanggok.

01:01:34.357 --> 01:01:36.275
You chose to save her despite knowing who…

01:01:38.361 --> 01:01:39.195
she really was?

01:01:40.363 --> 01:01:41.197
Seo Yul.

01:01:41.989 --> 01:01:44.450
If you are the only one
who knows the truth about her,

01:01:44.951 --> 01:01:46.369
pretend you know nothing.

01:01:48.329 --> 01:01:51.666
The soul of Naksu will disappear soon.

01:01:52.458 --> 01:01:55.503
Once the soul of Jin Bu-yeon,
the true owner of that body, awakens,

01:01:56.003 --> 01:01:58.464
Naksu's soul will no longer exist.

01:01:59.424 --> 01:02:00.258
What?

01:02:02.218 --> 01:02:03.594
What are you saying right now?

01:02:04.178 --> 01:02:06.055
Right now, there are
two souls in that body.

01:02:06.681 --> 01:02:08.808
But the body is Jin Bu-yeon's.

01:02:10.393 --> 01:02:12.562
- [Seo Yul gasps]
- Contrary to my original intentions,

01:02:12.645 --> 01:02:15.148
everything has gone
in favor of Bu-yeon's will.

01:02:15.732 --> 01:02:17.984
Once Naksu's energy is entirely consumed…

01:02:20.278 --> 01:02:21.362
she will disappear.

01:02:22.989 --> 01:02:24.240
[breathes shakily]

01:02:30.538 --> 01:02:33.750
Young Lady Heo!
Master Heo's asking where you are.

01:02:35.084 --> 01:02:36.085
[Yun-ok] Thank you, Sun-i.

01:02:37.503 --> 01:02:39.589
I'll be there soon. You go now.

01:02:41.299 --> 01:02:42.133
Uh…

01:02:45.052 --> 01:02:48.389
That looked like
Young Master Seo's letter from before.

01:02:49.307 --> 01:02:50.349
Is she taking a look?

01:02:55.730 --> 01:02:56.856
Naksu is that…

01:02:59.984 --> 01:03:01.027
woman then?

01:03:07.241 --> 01:03:09.076
[Jin] If someone is so dear to you,

01:03:09.160 --> 01:03:12.705
don't ever think of
letting them go and abandoning them.

01:03:12.789 --> 01:03:15.708
[Maid Kim] But the place that
she's supposed to be is right here.

01:03:15.792 --> 01:03:16.626
[sighs]

01:03:23.841 --> 01:03:26.636
It turned off. Did she break it
when she was messing with it?

01:03:30.681 --> 01:03:32.099
It keeps flickering.

01:03:33.100 --> 01:03:34.477
It must be losing its mind.

01:03:35.144 --> 01:03:37.772
[Bu-yeon] To tell you the truth,
I was hoping that…

01:03:38.648 --> 01:03:40.358
even though you didn't need me…

01:03:42.151 --> 01:03:43.778
you still chose to take me with.

01:03:44.362 --> 01:03:45.196
[sighs]

01:03:51.577 --> 01:03:52.870
I would be crazy…

01:03:54.831 --> 01:03:56.249
if I went back there again.

01:04:01.212 --> 01:04:04.048
If you drink that, that means
we are officially married, all right?

01:04:04.131 --> 01:04:06.050
Uk. Drink up.

01:04:11.013 --> 01:04:12.306
I'm always going to stay.

01:04:13.224 --> 01:04:14.559
[Bu-yeon] Summon some fireflies.

01:04:14.642 --> 01:04:16.894
[Jang Uk] That is definitely
not an easy thing to do, you know.

01:04:17.520 --> 01:04:19.397
Get a hold of yourself, jeez.

01:04:20.064 --> 01:04:21.232
[fire flickers]

01:04:23.985 --> 01:04:25.278
I'm going mad.

01:04:27.613 --> 01:04:28.447
[sighs]

01:04:29.699 --> 01:04:32.743
Mother knows you are still here.
She told me to get you.

01:04:32.827 --> 01:04:34.287
I was going to go leave today.

01:04:35.496 --> 01:04:36.664
I ran into Master Lee.

01:04:36.747 --> 01:04:38.624
He's the one taking care of Seo Yul.

01:04:38.708 --> 01:04:40.626
I wanted to see Seo Yul wake up.

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:44.922
Jang Uk thinks
you're in Jinyowon right now.

01:04:46.716 --> 01:04:48.217
So he's really not coming.

01:04:50.469 --> 01:04:51.304
I know.

01:04:52.930 --> 01:04:54.473
[inhales sharply]
Let's go.

01:04:55.892 --> 01:04:58.728
[gasps] I need to return
Songrim's Spirit Plaque before I go.

01:04:58.811 --> 01:05:00.062
It's over at Jeongjingak.

01:05:00.146 --> 01:05:02.023
I'll go get it quickly. Wait for me.

01:05:02.607 --> 01:05:03.441
Uh…

01:05:08.613 --> 01:05:09.488
[sighs]

01:05:17.330 --> 01:05:19.290
[soft music playing]

01:05:25.880 --> 01:05:27.798
You know you could get
100 flogs for losing this?

01:05:34.263 --> 01:05:35.598
I didn't lose it.

01:05:35.681 --> 01:05:36.515
Why?

01:05:37.183 --> 01:05:38.643
Do you want me to lose it and get flogged?

01:05:43.898 --> 01:05:45.107
I went to Jinyowon,

01:05:46.484 --> 01:05:47.401
but you weren't there.

01:05:48.527 --> 01:05:50.821
Were… you looking for me?

01:05:52.865 --> 01:05:53.699
Why?

01:05:55.910 --> 01:05:58.245
The lantern turned off. But then…

01:05:59.664 --> 01:06:00.539
it turned back on again.

01:06:00.623 --> 01:06:02.708
Lantern? The one in your study?

01:06:02.792 --> 01:06:05.252
It kept flickering on and off
like it had gone crazy.

01:06:07.129 --> 01:06:08.130
[sighs]

01:06:08.214 --> 01:06:09.256
It must be useless then.

01:06:10.132 --> 01:06:11.217
Just throw it away.

01:06:12.218 --> 01:06:13.052
That's right.

01:06:13.719 --> 01:06:15.054
It belongs to Jinyowon.

01:06:17.139 --> 01:06:18.307
Then you can just send it back.

01:06:18.391 --> 01:06:20.851
Since you think I left you
because I have no use for you,

01:06:21.477 --> 01:06:22.687
I suppose I should

01:06:23.521 --> 01:06:25.648
explain why I wanted to use you
so you'll understand.

01:06:28.234 --> 01:06:29.402
I took you home because…

01:06:31.028 --> 01:06:32.822
I was hoping
you'd take out what's within me.

01:06:33.489 --> 01:06:34.323
I know.

01:06:35.032 --> 01:06:36.909
You said you had to
remove it to be at peace.

01:06:38.494 --> 01:06:39.328
Right.

01:06:40.496 --> 01:06:41.747
I wanted to find some peace.

01:06:43.624 --> 01:06:44.667
But once it's removed…

01:06:46.293 --> 01:06:47.294
it would kill me.

01:06:48.879 --> 01:06:50.589
Don't blame yourself
because you couldn't have known.

01:06:51.132 --> 01:06:52.967
It's my fault for not
being honest with you.

01:06:53.884 --> 01:06:55.845
At first, I didn't think
you needed to know.

01:06:56.971 --> 01:06:59.682
And later on, I couldn't tell someone
so determined to protect me.

01:07:02.727 --> 01:07:03.602
So what about now?

01:07:04.311 --> 01:07:05.646
I told you I have no use for you.

01:07:09.066 --> 01:07:10.735
So what I really mean by that is I am…

01:07:12.945 --> 01:07:14.196
very grateful for you.

01:07:15.573 --> 01:07:16.949
And I'm sorry for how I've acted.

01:07:17.616 --> 01:07:18.492
[scoffs]

01:07:21.078 --> 01:07:21.954
If that's true…

01:07:23.205 --> 01:07:25.166
then I'm glad you don't have
a use for me anymore.

01:07:25.249 --> 01:07:26.584
[scoffs]

01:07:26.667 --> 01:07:28.586
I was miserable
believing you abandoned me.

01:07:29.503 --> 01:07:32.381
But now you're thanking me
and apologizing.

01:07:34.300 --> 01:07:35.593
You came here just to say that?

01:07:37.094 --> 01:07:38.971
I heard you clearly, and now I'm going.

01:07:40.556 --> 01:07:42.183
Can't say I'd wish you a good life though.

01:07:45.019 --> 01:07:46.270
What do you want from me?

01:07:46.854 --> 01:07:49.065
You want me to wait for you
to change your mind someday?

01:07:49.565 --> 01:07:52.485
I never want to see you again.

01:07:52.568 --> 01:07:54.111
Or I might just rip it out of you.

01:07:55.196 --> 01:07:56.155
I'm not done.

01:07:56.906 --> 01:07:58.657
I told you I came
because the lantern was flickering.

01:07:58.741 --> 01:08:00.451
- Why does that matter though?
- It means…

01:08:04.830 --> 01:08:06.207
when it's on, I feel like I'm sane.

01:08:07.666 --> 01:08:08.542
I understand…

01:08:09.835 --> 01:08:11.837
that I have to send you back
like I had promised.

01:08:12.421 --> 01:08:14.340
But as soon as it turns off, I go insane.

01:08:14.965 --> 01:08:16.050
I want to see you.

01:08:18.177 --> 01:08:19.637
That's why I came all this way.

01:08:28.395 --> 01:08:29.230
So what?

01:08:32.983 --> 01:08:33.818
What about now?

01:08:35.820 --> 01:08:37.613
If you're leaving because you're furious…

01:08:41.158 --> 01:08:42.535
then I'll get myself together and…

01:08:45.538 --> 01:08:46.372
let you go.

01:08:46.455 --> 01:08:48.457
[soft music playing]

01:08:55.589 --> 01:08:56.757
[music stops]

01:09:02.096 --> 01:09:02.930
What's that?

01:09:03.013 --> 01:09:04.348
I blew it out.

01:09:08.352 --> 01:09:09.478
To turn the light off.

01:09:10.521 --> 01:09:12.523
[tender music playing]

01:09:19.780 --> 01:09:21.782
["I′m Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:10:36.982 --> 01:10:39.902
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:10:39.985 --> 01:10:41.445
I knew when I saw you.

01:10:41.528 --> 01:10:42.446
[Bu-yeon] You're my husband.

01:10:42.988 --> 01:10:44.281
[Jang Uk] "I promise to be good to her."

01:10:44.365 --> 01:10:46.116
"So please allow me
to marry your daughter, Bu-yeon."

01:10:46.200 --> 01:10:48.702
[Seo Yul] Just let her
with the person she wishes to be with,

01:10:48.786 --> 01:10:49.620
even if it's brief.

01:10:49.703 --> 01:10:51.580
[Go Won] If you do not intend
to fight me over the Gold Plaque,

01:10:51.664 --> 01:10:53.082
go up north, Jang Uk.

01:10:53.165 --> 01:10:55.751
[Jang Uk] …and have ultimately decided
to accept this fight

01:10:55.834 --> 01:10:57.086
to protect what I must.

01:10:57.169 --> 01:11:00.005
I will soon invite Your Highness
to one of our meetings.

01:11:00.089 --> 01:11:02.758
Tell me what you need
and I'll help you, whatever it may be.

01:11:02.841 --> 01:11:04.343
[Seo Yul]
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

01:11:04.426 --> 01:11:06.762
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

01:11:06.845 --> 01:11:09.932
[Jin Mu] Please allow me
to test your powers.
